tatus, and per-benchmark scores in the Dashboard; comparing\n54\t  two model versions side by side.\n55\t- Embedding evaluation in Data Science Pipelines to gate promotion flows.\n56\t- Interpreting cost/duration metadata (tokens, wall-clock, GPU time) for\n57\t  capacity planning.\n58\t\n59\t## Acceptance Criteria\n60\t\n61\t- The documentation covers the evaluation workflow end to end, including custom\n62\t  task authoring, with each topic above addressed.\n63\t- The content is technically reviewed against the implemented capability and\n64\t  validated against the platform architecture context (component names,\n65\t  interfaces, and maturity claims match reality).\n66\t- The topics are published in the RHOAI product documentation set.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\tHLR-9 (P2): product documentation covers the evaluation workflow end to end,\n71\tincluding custom task authoring. Epic priority is P0 per the docs-authoring\n72\texception (strategy frontmatter priority: Critical → P0).\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a1f23eaf6561900a","agent_id":"a5cb189c64bbe30d4","session_id":"b202a2e5-2f2e-4be7-874a-783267f0136d","uuid":"f0d5a7ff-8fbe-4dce-99a4-88223339b0af","timestamp":"2026-10-22T14:06:03.208Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8d525d115b37cd0b","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Second revision of RHAISTRAT-9002"}
