{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-90ed633c4fcffac3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9002-E008\n3\ttitle: 'Data Science Pipelines: evaluation step for promotion-gating flows'\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9002\n5\tcomponent: Data Science Pipelines\n6\tteam: RHOAI Pipelines\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E006\n12\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n13\tgate_failure_impact:\n14\t  action: rewrite\n15\t  fallback_approach: The pipeline step shape and gating behavior are unchanged by\n16\t    the execution engine decision, but the launch invocation is rewritten to whichever\n17\t    surface the decision selects.\n18\tai_signals:\n19\t  change_specificity: 0\n20\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n21\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n22\t  existing_foundation: 1\n23\t  open_questions: -1\n24\t  external_dependency: 1\n25\t  human_process_gates: 1\n26\t  repo_access: 1\n27\t  architecture_claims: 1\n28\timplementation_type: null\n29\tinvestigation_signals: null\n30\tai_implementability: High\n31\tai_implementability_score: 6\n32\tjira_key: null\n33\tbranch: null\n34\t---\n35\t# Data Science Pipelines: Evaluation step for promotion-gating flows\n36\t\n37\t## Description\n38\t\n39\tMake evaluation embeddable as a step in a Data Science Pipeline, so promotion\n40\tflows can gate on evaluation scores. A pipeline author adds an evaluation step\n41\tthat runs a benchmark suite against a served model; downstream steps gate on\n42\tthe resulting scores. Humans make the promotion decision — the pipeline gates,\n43\tit does not promote (automatic promotion is explicitly out of scope for this\n44\tstrategy).\n45\t\n46\t## Scope\n47\t\n48\t- A reusable pipeline step (KFP v2 component) that launches an evaluation of a\n49\t  model served on the platform against a selected benchmark suite, standard or\n50\t  custom.\n51\t- Support for gating downstream pipeline steps on evaluation scores, e.g.\n52\t  threshold checks against the persisted results linked to the model version.\n53\t- The step surfaces the evaluation's outcome (scores, pass/fail against\n54\t  thresholds) to the pipeline run for branching.\n55\t- A documented example of a promotion-gating flow using the step.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- A Data Science Pipeline can include an evaluation step that runs against a\n60\t  served model and completes with the evaluation's status.\n61\t- Downstream steps can gate on the evaluation's scores (pass/fail on a\n62\t  configurable threshold) using the persisted results.\n63\t- The step works for both standard benchmark suites and custom evaluation\n64\t  tasks.\n65\t- A worked example of a promotion-gating pipeline is provided, with the\n66\t  promotion decision left to a human.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\tHLR-6 (P1): evaluations can be embedded as a step in a Data Science Pipeline so\n71\tpromotion flows can gate on scores.\n72\t\n73\t## Risks / Notes\n74\t\n75\t- The step's launch invocation (API or CR) depends on the execution engine\n76\t  decision; the component shape and gating behavior are identical either way.\n77\t  Start after that decision resolves.\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a374a083ce15c2b1","agent_id":"a26eaf71c516d7bc2","session_id":"b202a2e5-2f2e-4be7-874a-783267f0136d","uuid":"62b3513b-04ce-4df7-98a5-feb9a1e88572","timestamp":"2026-10-22T14:07:25.675Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-90ed633c4fcffac3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Final review of RHAISTRAT-9002"}
