low.\n54\t- Viewing runs, status, and per-benchmark scores in the Dashboard; comparing\n55\t  two model versions side by side.\n56\t- Embedding evaluation in Data Science Pipelines to gate promotion flows.\n57\t- Interpreting cost/duration metadata (tokens, wall-clock, GPU time) for\n58\t  capacity planning.\n59\t\n60\t## Acceptance Criteria\n61\t\n62\t- The documentation covers the evaluation workflow end to end, including custom\n63\t  task authoring, with each topic above addressed.\n64\t- The content is technically reviewed against the implemented capability and\n65\t  validated against the platform architecture context (component names,\n66\t  interfaces, and maturity claims match reality).\n67\t- The topics are published in the RHOAI product documentation set.\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\tHLR-9 (P2): product documentation covers the evaluation workflow end to end,\n72\tincluding custom task authoring. Epic priority is P0 per the docs-authoring\n73\texception (strategy frontmatter priority: Critical → P0).\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a374a083ce15c2b1","agent_id":"a26eaf71c516d7bc2","session_id":"b202a2e5-2f2e-4be7-874a-783267f0136d","uuid":"8ac3fa43-9984-4dfa-a8b7-2455276b372e","timestamp":"2026-10-22T14:07:26.756Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8304c6b0844fcfb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Final review of RHAISTRAT-9002"}
