ider API onto platform evaluation launches and results:\n52\t  benchmark suite selection maps to the platform's suite set, and returned\n53\t  results use the canonical result schema.\n54\t- Make the provider available in LlamaStackDistribution deployments without\n55\t  custom user wiring.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- A Llama Stack app or agent using the eval provider API receives results\n60\t  consistent with the platform evaluation flow for the same model and suite.\n61\t- The provider is available in platform Llama Stack distributions by default,\n62\t  requiring no custom user configuration.\n63\t- Provider-level errors map sensibly to platform evaluation failures (run\n64\t  failures surface as provider errors, not silent empty results).\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\tHLR-7 (P1): Llama Stack's eval provider API is backed by the platform\n69\tevaluation service, so agents/apps built on Llama Stack get the same results.\n70\t\n71\t## Risks / Notes\n72\t\n73\t- If the provider cannot be carried entirely in the midstream distribution,\n74\t  coordination with upstream Llama Stack (meta-llama/llama-stack) may be\n75\t  needed; treat that as a risk to escalate, not a reason to redesign the\n76\t  platform-side wiring.\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a374a083ce15c2b1","agent_id":"a26eaf71c516d7bc2","session_id":"b202a2e5-2f2e-4be7-874a-783267f0136d","uuid":"36fcb624-cc6b-43e2-9e66-e9ad919f9aef","timestamp":"2026-10-22T14:07:31.926Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b7c32147c8d37ccd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Final review of RHAISTRAT-9002"}
